# Google Play publishing identity.
#
# `json_key_file` points at a Play Console service-account key, kept at the
# repo root beside keystore.properties and forge.properties and gitignored
# the same way. The project's convention is credentials in files rather than
# environment variables: a variable set with setx does not reach a process
# that is already running, which has cost this project releases before.
#
# To create the key: Play Console > Users and permissions > invite a service
# account (or Google Cloud > IAM > Service accounts > Keys > Add key > JSON),
# grant it "Release apps to testing tracks" and "Release to production", then
# save the downloaded JSON as play-service-account.json at the repo root.
json_key_file(File.expand_path("../../../play-service-account.json", __dir__))
package_name("app.indoorbike")
